<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Ericsson.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Ericsson.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 7.5 million American-style call warrants on shares of Ericsson Telecommunications Co, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    350 SEK		   PREMIUM	24.61 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.92 CHF		  GEARING	6.56 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   28.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	22.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  320 SEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
